{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11115214","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11115214","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1111521401:0":{"text":"あたしたちはこんな所で倒れたりしない！ココはアンお姉ちゃんと……みんなと一緒に帰るんだ！","source_cn":"我们不会在这里倒下！我要和安丹姐姐——和大家一起回去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x871AD4FA8DA2166E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1111521402:0":{"text":"私が攻撃を防ぐ！みんなは奴の隙をつけ！","source_cn":"我来抵御他的攻击！大家抓住机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5C023771788230B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111521403:0":{"text":"頑固な子たちですね……その苦しみももうすぐ終わりますよ、次が最後の一句です。","source_cn":"执拗的孩子们……痛苦就快结束了，我即将写完最后的一句。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB91B2317ABAE8AFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡卡":{"text":"ココ","source":"卡卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:安丹德拉":{"text":"アンダンドラ","source":"安丹德拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:普鲁斯托":{"text":"プルースト","source":"普鲁斯托","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":3}}